            "review_title": "Review at Zumwhere Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Gaurav Aggarwal\nNew Delhi, India720 contributions\n0\nGreat place\nJun 2025 • Business\nA modern Japanese cuisine restaurant with a twist to contemporary dishes. The ambiance is beautiful and outdoor section is much better. It provides a bohemian vibe and very soothing. Definitely a place to go on a date with your lover. It was a team dinner for me. However the food was excellent, salmon tacos, grilled asparagus etc. the cocktails from Japan and aperol were amazing.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2025",
